  "description": {
    "text": "The 2026 Happy Meal promotion. Each Happy Meal held two loose cards, one holo and one not, and a toy shaped like a miniature Happy Meal box, one of 15, whose keyring folds out to stand a card on. In Quebec a Pokémon sticker and a four-card booster pack took the toy's place. It began in Canada on 3 November 2026, in Australia on 5 November and in the United States on 10 November, with other countries following month by month until Ireland and the United Kingdom in February 2027.\n\nAll 15 cards reprint cards from earlier expansions under the set's own numbers. Seven are holo: Chandelure, Palafin, Pikachu, Mimikyu, Lucario, Tyranitar and Jirachi. The Pokémon Company's announcement on 29 October 2026 first showed the cards of the 2027 collection by mistake; it was taken down and came back the next day with these 15."
  },
  "tell": {
    "text": "An \"M26 EN\" code at the bottom left, and a number out of 015"
  },
